{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots - Light on the Sea is a narrative story driven game where you live and work on a small island with a lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take care of the facility, check the weather, scout ships, file reports, order needed goods and unravel the story behind the lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience changes from day to night and a random weather system with storms, rain or fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.poster.avif?t=1760796626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.webm?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.mp4?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout ships and file reports about the type and the speed in knots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.poster.avif?t=1760796626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.webm?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.mp4?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive on the island: Prepare food, report daily weather and earn money through reports to buy needed goods on the pc via the internet online store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy resources for the lighthouse, ingredients for cooking, seeds for the garden etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to radio or just relax in the garden looking at the sunset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/af554a00b26a88904047d21e5bc6ecee.avif?t=1760796626\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric story driven adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day to night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised weather system (each playthrough will be a little bit different)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tasks of a lighthouse keeper (take care of the light and the fog horn, scout ships, file daily weather reports, cook food, order items, plant and collect your own vegetables)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the in-game radio music (Ambient, Classic and Guitar Soundtrack available)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the story behind the lighthouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106450?t=1760796626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/13df7ab7e9284ebd076e547e49add4c167ed247a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760796626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/2386c428cd0ac8ce2e449581b73945dacf06c3a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760796626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/2386c428cd0ac8ce2e449581b73945dacf06c3a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760796626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Story may not be suitable for all age groups"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots - Light on the Sea is a narrative story driven game where you live and work on a small island with a lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take care of the facility, check the weather, scout ships, file reports, order needed goods and unravel the story behind the lighthouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience changes from day to night and a random weather system with storms, rain or fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.poster.avif?t=1760796626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.webm?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/a7924fd3747a6fde081c0728f9450dec.mp4?t=1760796626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout ships and file reports about the type and the speed in knots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106450/extras/42fc395481c67d985f191fb44669826a.poster.avif?t=1760796626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset